  m_text: 'Your goal is to get a hole in the wall

    You will achieve this by hammering
    the wall (red pannels until color is "drained") and by drilling (green dots,
    until a "black" hole is visible).

    If you feel overwhelmed you can back out
    at any time!


    Good Luck'
